{"unit_id":"superfish058__dsh-llm-proxy#card-zh","repo":"superfish058/dsh-llm-proxy","commit":"a0aa646474037e30b8354fb85b598103507b7f6f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@superfish058/dsh-llm-proxy（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：按模型选择代理路由，让需要代理的模型请求经过指定代理，其余模型保持直连。它在 DSH 的模型请求传输层接入，可复用官方出站代理引擎，也可在旧环境使用内置路由器。主要功能包括选择要代理的模型、设置代理主机和端口、将重试参数同步到所选 provider、查看模型列表，以及逐模型测试连接并显示状态、耗时和实际路由。适合需要让部分模型走本地或远程代理、同时保留其他模型直连的 DSH 用户。设置可在插件页面实时修改；默认代理地址为 127.0.0.1:7897。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:283","lib/index.js:347","src/client/index.ts:78","lib/connection-test.js:264"]}
{"unit_id":"superfish058__dsh-llm-proxy#card-en","repo":"superfish058/dsh-llm-proxy","commit":"a0aa646474037e30b8354fb85b598103507b7f6f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@superfish058/dsh-llm-proxy (DSH web plugin) routes selected model APIs through a proxy while keeping others direct. It reuses the official proxy engine or falls back to its bundled router. Web settings select models and configure retries; connection checks report status, latency, and route.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:283","lib/index.js:347","src/client/index.ts:78","lib/connection-test.js:264"]}
